{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-news-detail-template-js","path":"/blog/provident-wins-emaar-broker-awards/","result":{"data":{"strapiBlog":{"createdAt":"2025-02-13T06:21:21.870Z","updatedAt":"2025-02-17T06:23:44.882Z","video_url":null,"title":"Zoya Ventures Real Estate Wins Big at Emaar’s Annual Brokers Award 2024","short_description":"Zoya Ventures Real Estate continues to cement its position as a leader in Dubai’s real estate sector, securing the prestigious Top Sales Partner title at Emaar’s Annual Brokers Award 2024.","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Provident_Estate_Wins_Big_at_Emaar_s_Annual_Brokers_Award_2024_8d336bd722.jpg"},"team_contact":null,"strapi_id":390,"slug":"provident-wins-emaar-broker-awards","publish":true,"id":"87cfd906-6357-59bf-95c8-3ca523437c64","rank":null,"date":"February 13, 2025","category":{"strapi_json_value":["Dubai Market Trends & News"],"id":"3f0a7d3c-603e-5184-9785-b0dcd5f5e207"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Provident_Estate_Wins_Big_at_Emaar_s_Annual_Brokers_Award_2024_8d336bd722.jpg"},"author":null,"modules":[{"id":"256e0dc0-4db2-5b83-849c-d27c661f25f1","strapi_component":"components.rich-text-block","strapi_id":808,"text":{"data":{"text":"<p>Zoya Ventures Real Estate continues to cement its position as a leader in Dubai’s real estate sector, securing the prestigious Top Sales Partner title at Emaar’s Annual Brokers Award 2024.</p><p>Held at the iconic Dubai Opera on February 11th, 2025, the glamorous event brought together the crème de la crème of the real estate industry to celebrate top-performing agencies. Zoya Ventures Real Estate’s outstanding achievement reflects its relentless dedication, industry expertise, and an unwavering commitment to delivering excellence in the Dubai property market.</p><p>As the city’s real estate market continues to evolve, Zoya Ventures Real Estate remains committed to innovation, client satisfaction, and driving forward the highest industry standards. With this award, the company sets its sights on even greater achievements in the year ahead.</p><h2>About Zoya Ventures Real Estate</h2><p>Established in 2008, <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/\">Zoya Ventures Real Estate</a> is a full-service property consultancy firm in Dubai, specializing in residential and commercial sales, leasing, property management, and investment advisory. Known for its commitment to excellence and market expertise, Zoya Ventures Real Estate continues to redefine the real estate experience in the UAE.</p><h2>Emaar Broker Awards: Celebrating the Best in the Business</h2><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-emaar-properties/\">Emaar Properties</a>, a leading real estate developer in Dubai, hosts the annual Broker Awards to recognize and honor the outstanding contributions of brokerage firms in the real estate sector. These awards celebrate agencies that have demonstrated exceptional performance, commitment to excellence, and significant achievements in property sales.</p><blockquote class=\"instagram-media\" style=\"background:#FFF;border-radius:3px;border:0;box-shadow:0 0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5),0 1px 10px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.15);margin:1px;max-width:540px;min-width:326px;padding:0;width:calc(100% - 2px);\" data-instgrm-captioned=\"\" data-instgrm-permalink=\"https://instagram.com/reel/DGDLpyuJgGN/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" data-instgrm-version=\"14\"><div style=\"padding:16px;\"><div style=\"align-items:center;display:flex;flex-direction:row;\"><div style=\"background-color:#F4F4F4;border-radius:50%;flex-grow:0;height:40px;margin-right:14px;width:40px;\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;flex-grow:1;justify-content:center;\"><div style=\"background-color:#F4F4F4;border-radius:4px;flex-grow:0;height:14px;mar